              "value": "Light Pulse"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, light, primal, visual)\n\n50 feet. The moonflower releases a pulse of bright light. Each non-moonflower creature in the emanation must attempt a DC 23 Fortitude save. The moonflower can't use Light Pulse again for 1d4 rounds.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is dazzled for 1d4 rounds.\nCritical Failure: The creature is blinded for 1d4 rounds."
